  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support aims at capacitating NAP+SAR to establish itself as a key representative of PLHIV in Southern Africa. It is envisaged that the project will bring visibility of the role and responsibilities of PLHIV networks in the fight against HIV &amp; AIDSin the region  representing the interests of national org. and networks of PLHIV. NAP+SAR is hosted under the Southern Africa AIDS Trust (SAT).</narrative>
